ul.li:
MUST contain every REQUIRED material field of that type,
          encoded per the field types the type definition declares
          ();

MAY contain additional members beyond those the type
          definition declares. Extra members are covered by the
          digest;

ol.li:
collects every configured definition, from all of its
            definition sources, that is an object whose action_type member
            is exactly that string;

refuses with invalid_definition when any collected
            definition does not conform, or when two collected definitions
            have different definition_sha256 values;

ul.li:
A target_field may be any
          field name other than action_type, so a required field such as
          @version can be mapped ().

